		{"value":"<p>\r\n\tThe Padma bridge will be constructed, said Juan Miranda, director general of South Asia Department of Asian Development Bank, on Thursday.</p>\r\n<p>\r\n\t&quot;I am confident that Padma bridge will be built,&quot; Juan Miranda who came to Dhaka on a two-day visit on Wednesday told this to reporters emerging from a meeting with Finance Minister AMA Muhith at latter&#39;s office.</p>\r\n<p>\r\n\tThe Padma bridge will be constructed, said Juan Miranda, director general of South Asia Department of Asian Development Bank, on Thursday.</p>\r\n<p>\r\n\t&quot;I am confident that Padma bridge will be built,&quot; Juan Miranda who came to Dhaka on a two-day visit on Wednesday told this to reporters emerging from a meeting with Finance Minister AMA Muhith at latter&#39;s office.</p>\r\n", "format":"1"}
